{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "09", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "06", "M": "35", "S": "28"}}, "news": [{"title": "Birla Estates' subsidiary buys FSI from Parinee entities for \u20b9159 crore", "para": "Birla Estates has successfully acquired almost 90,000 sq ft of FSI for over Rs 159 crore, a strategic move aimed at bolstering their society redevelopment efforts in Khar, Mumbai. This FSI was secured via a Slum Rehabilitation Authority scheme from Kandivali. The development rights will be transferred and applied to a larger property in Khar, enhancing the region's premium living environment.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/birla-estates-subsidiary-buys-fsi-from-parinee-entities-for-159-crore/133063094?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-417734/133063094.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "Dream Finders to buy Beazer Homes in $2.2-billion deal", "para": "Dream Finders Homes is set to acquire Beazer Homes in a substantial $2.2 billion all-cash transaction, marking a pivotal expansion in Dream Finders' footprint within the housing sector. Shareholders of Beazer will receive $33.50 cash for each share held, while the deal is anticipated to finalize by the end of the fourth quarter in 2026, bringing a conclusion to extensive talks between the two firms.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/dream-finders-to-buy-beazer-homes-in-2-2-billion-deal/133062805?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-50352/133062805.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "international"}, {"title": "Chennai metro rail phase-II 54% complete", "para": "Chennai Metro Rail Phase-II has achieved 54.62% physical progress on its extensive network. The Union government has released over \u20b914,545 crore for the p